      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Conclusion: every data plane in this system — Cosmos, AI Search, Key Vault, the registry and Microsoft Foundry — is reachable only from inside the VNet, and the sole public surface is the demo UI front door.",
