      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "docs/architecture.md and the constitution both require all model\ntraffic to transit APIM for token metering, cost ceilings and content\nsafety. No azurerm_api_management resource exists in either stack,\nand no private DNS zone for it is declared. Today the router calls the\nFoundry data plane directly over the foundry private endpoint.",
      "originalText": "docs/architecture.md and the constitution both require all model\ntraffic to transit APIM for token metering, cost ceilings and content\nsafety. No azurerm_api_management resource exists in either stack,\nand no private DNS zone for it is declared. Today the router calls the\nFoundry data plane directly over the foundry private endpoint.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
